#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, checkBoxForce)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/commitpushdialog.ui:88
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Usually, the command refuses to update a remote ref "
"that is not an ancestor of the local ref used to overwrite it. Also, when --"
"force-with-lease option is used, the command refuses to update a remote ref "
"whose current value does not match what is expected.</p><p>This flag "
"disables these checks, and can cause the remote repository to lose commits; "
"use it with care.</p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-"
"push#Documentation/git-push.txt--f\"><span style=\" text-decoration: "
"underline; color:#007af4;\">More information...</span></a></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Naredba obično odbija ažurirati udaljenu referencu "
"koja nije predak lokalne reference kojom bi se prepisala. Također, ako se "
"koristi mogućnost --force-with-lease, naredba odbija ažurirati udaljenu "
"referencu čija trenutačna vrijednost ne odgovara očekivanoj.</p><p>Ova "
"zastavica isključuje te provjere i može uzrokovati gubitak potvrda u "
"udaljenom spremištu; koristite je oprezno.</p><p><br/></p><p><a "
"href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-push#Documentation/git-push.txt--f\"><span "
"style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">Više informacija...</span>"
"</a></p></body></html>"

