#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, comboBoxStrategy)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The merge mechanism (git merge and git pull commands) "
"allows the backend merge strategies to be chosen with -s option. Some "
"strategies can also take their own options, which can be passed by giving -"
"X&lt;option&gt; arguments to git merge and/or git pull.</p><p><a href="
"\"https://git-scm.com/docs/merge-strategies\"><span style=\" text-"
"decoration: underline; color:#2980b9;\">More information</span></a></p></"
"body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Mehanizam spajanja (naredbe git merge i git pull) omogućuje odabir pozadinskih strategija spajanja opcijom -s. Neke strategije imaju i vlastite mogućnosti koje se mogu proslijediti naredbi git merge i/ili git pull argumentima -X&lt;mogućnost&gt;.</p><p><a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/merge-strategies\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#2980b9;\">Više informacija</span></a></p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:46
#, kde-format
msgid "To:"
msgstr "U:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_4)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:60
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/pulldialog.ui:79
#, kde-format
msgid "Fast forward:"
msgstr "Brzo premotavanje:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, comboBoxFastForward)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:67
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Specifies how a merge is handled when the merged-in "
"history is already a descendant of the current history.</p><p><br/></p><p><a "
"href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-merge#Documentation/git-merge.txt---ff"
"\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">More "
"information</span></a></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Određuje način obrade spajanja kada je povijest koja se spaja već potomak trenutačne povijesti.</p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-merge#Documentation/git-merge.txt---ff\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">Više informacija</span></a></p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, comboBoxFastForward)
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, radioButtonDefault)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:71
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:130
#, kde-format
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Zadano"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, comboBoxFastForward)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:76
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow fast forward"
msgstr "Dopusti brzo premotavanje"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, comboBoxFastForward)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:81
#, kde-format
