#, kde-format
msgid "No fast forward"
msgstr "Bez brzog premotavanja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, checkBoxAllowUnrelatedHistories)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:94
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>By default, git merge command refuses to merge "
"histories that do not share a common ancestor. This option can be used to "
"override this safety when merging histories of two projects that started "
"their lives independently. As that is a very rare occasion, no configuration "
"variable to enable this by default exists and will not be added.</p><p><br/"
"></p><p><a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-merge#Documentation/git-merge."
"txt---allow-unrelated-histories\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; "
"color:#007af4;\">More information</span></a></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Naredba git merge prema zadanim postavkama odbija spajanje povijesti koje nemaju zajedničkog pretka. Ova mogućnost nadjačava tu zaštitu pri spajanju povijesti dvaju projekata koji su započeli neovisno jedan o drugome. Budući da je to vrlo rijedak slučaj, ne postoji konfiguracijska varijabla za zadano uključivanje te mogućnosti i neće biti dodana.</p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-merge#Documentation/git-merge.txt---allow-unrelated-histories\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">Više informacija</span></a></p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, checkBoxAllowUnrelatedHistories)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:97
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow unrelated histories"
msgstr "Dopusti nepovezane povijesti"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, checkBoxSquash)
#: src/libkommitwidgets/dialogs/mergedialog.ui:107
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Produce the working tree and index state as if a real "
"merge happened (except for the merge information), but do not actually make "
"a commit, move the HEAD, or record $GIT_DIR/MERGE_HEAD (to cause the next "
"git commit command to create a merge commit). This allows you to create a "
"single commit on top of the current branch whose effect is the same as "
"merging another branch (or more in case of an octopus).</p><p><br/></p><p><a "
"href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-merge#Documentation/git-merge.txt---"
"squash\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">More "
"information</span></a></p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Stvori stanje radnog stabla i indeksa kao da je obavljeno stvarno spajanje (osim informacija o spajanju), ali nemoj stvoriti potvrdu, pomaknuti HEAD ni zabilježiti $GIT_DIR/MERGE_HEAD (što bi uzrokovalo da sljedeća naredba git commit stvori potvrdu spajanja). Tako se na trenutačnoj grani može stvoriti jedna potvrda čiji je učinak jednak spajanju druge grane (ili više njih u slučaju spajanja hobotnice).</p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-merge#Documentation/git-merge.txt---squash\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#007af4;\">Više informacija</span></a></p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, checkBoxSquash)
